hpc:Designcenter a owl:Class .
hpc:DesigncenterB a owl:Class .
hpc:Host a owl:Class .
hpc:CandidateHost rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Host .
hpc:LicenseSchedulerHost rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Host .
hpc:LocalLicenseSchedulerHost rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Host .
hpc:licenseScheduler a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Designcenter ;
    rdfs:range hpc:LicenseSchedulerHost .
hpc:candidateLicenseScheduler a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Designcenter ;
    rdfs:range hpc:CandidateHost .
hpc:nextCandidateHost a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:CandidateHost ;
    rdfs:range hpc:CandidateHost .
hpc:hosts a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Designcenter ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:WanConnection a owl:Class .
hpc:heartbeat a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:LocalLicenseSchedulerHost ;
    rdfs:range hpc:LicenseSchedulerHost .
hpc:FailoverDaemon a owl:Class .
hpc:BlcollectDaemon a owl:Class .


This ontology fragment represents the classes `DesignCenter`, `DesignCenter_B`, `Host`, `Candidate_Host`, `License_Scheduler_Host`, `Local_License_Scheduler_Host`, `License_Scheduler`, `Candidate_License_Scheduler`, `Next_Candidate_Host`, `Hosts`, `WAN_Connection`, and `Heartbeat`. It also includes the object properties `License_Scheduler`, `Candidate_License_Scheduler`, `Next_Candidate_Host`, `Hosts`, and `Heartbeat`, and the datatype property `WAN_Connection`. The properties have the appropriate domains and ranges defined.
